OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CMajor award for university's           
OL,5,Ctransformation of Edinburgh hospital   
OL,6,GThe restoration of a Victorian         
OL,7,Ghospital by a university in an         
OL,8,G"extraordinary transformation" has     
OL,9,Gbeen awarded Scotland's biggest        
OL,10,Garchitecture prize.                    
OL,12,FThe University of Edinburgh            
OL,13,Ftransformed the city's Old Royal       
OL,14,FInfirmary into a "radically            
OL,15,Fcollaborative space for learning and   
OL,16,Fresearch" that has few, if any,        
OL,17,Fparallels in recent UK architecture.   
OL,19,FThe NHS vacated the Category A-listed  
OL,20,Fbuilding in 2003 and it was purchased  
OL,21,Fby the university in 2015 to become    
OL,22,Fthe Edinburgh Futures Institute.  G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
