OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,.-,.,,.-.-,.,/,-./,-,./
OL,4,CFloating nature islands installed in   
OL,5,Cparks as Glasgow Games legacy          
OL,6,GFloating islands are being installed   
OL,7,Gon ponds in five of Glasgow's parks as 
OL,8,Gpart of the 2026 Commonwealth Games    
OL,9,Glegacy.                                
OL,11,FThe islands, which are being planted   
OL,12,Fby community groups, are designed to   
OL,13,Fencourage wildlife and help clean the  
OL,14,Fwater.                                 
OL,16,FThe project will create almost 250     
OL,17,Fsquare metres of new wildlife habitat  
OL,18,Fwhich is expected to last about 20     
OL,19,Fyears.                                 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
